    body = [=[
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak with {n:Erlene} in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} at J-8 (first map) as a level 30+ job and you will get a cutscene.
** If you have it already, use the survival guide to get in {z:The Eldieme Necropolis (S)} or you can get there by entering from {z:Batallia Downs (S)} (J-10).
*** Once inside, walk straight down the tunnel into the room where it forks North and South and Erlene will be there.
* She requests 12 sheets of {@i:Vellum|2550} {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550}.
* {@i:Vellum|2550} {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} can be purchased from the {z:Auction House} under {p:Leathercraft} or can be obtained in exchange for {@i:Rolanberry|4365} {i:Rolanberries|Rolanberry|4365} from the NPC {n:Tucker}, located in {z:Crawlers' Nest (S)} at K-8 (first map).
** {n:Tucker} will only trade {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} after the quest has been activated and you speak to him.
** Tucker will accept 3 trades of up to 4 stacks of {@i:Rolanberry|4365} {i:Rolanberries|Rolanberry|4365} each per trade, so you can receive a maximum of 12 sheets of {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} from him.
** Even if you trade less than 4 stacks at once, that counts as one of your 3 trades. For example, if you trade him one stack of {i:Rolanberries|Rolanberry|4365} 3 times, you will only receive 3 sheets of {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} total.
** **TL;DR**: Head to {z:Crawlers' Nest (S)} with **12 stacks of 12** {@i:Rolanberry|4365} {i:rolanberries|Rolanberry|4365} in your inventory. (They can be bought for 120 gil from {n:Champalpieu} in {z:Upper Jeuno}.)
*** Trade **4 stacks** of {@i:Rolanberry|4365} {i:rolanberries|Rolanberry|4365} to {n:Tucker} **__at once**__ to receive 4 sheets of {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550}.
**** Repeat this another 2 times to receive all 12 sheets of {@i:Vellum|2550} {i:Vellum|Vellum|2550} needed for the quest, before getting blocked out from further trades with Tucker.
* If you are not a BLM, RDM, SMN, or BLU, change to one of those jobs now. It does not need to be level 30.
* After handing in the sheets to Erlene, you will get a cutscene. Then you will be asked to use one of the following {@g:Two-Hour ability|Two-Hour ability} {p:SP Abilities|Category:SP Ability}: {p:Astral Flow}, {p:Chainspell}, {p:Azure Lore} or {p:Manafont}.
* With one of these abilities in effect, speak to Erlene again to activate another cutscene. You will be rewarded with the {@k}{p:Grimoire} and the ability to change your job to {p:Scholar}.

=2 Notes
* Once your Scholar is level 5 or higher, return to Erlene in The Eldieme Necropolis (S) to learn the spells {s:Embrava} and {s:Kaustra}. These spells are not available via scroll, you will learn them automatically when speaking to her while on Scholar.

